# ── Local-only working docs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Kept out of the repo deliberately. Note this only stops them being committed —
# it is not an access control, and anyone with the working tree can read them.
# The spec at docs/HabitLab_AI_Analysis_Report.docx stays tracked; the copy at
# the repo root does not.
docs/architecture/
docs/engineering-guide/
docs/work-packages/
/HabitLab_AI_Analysis_Report.docx
